      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the `identity_client.py` file, I need to write the code that provides local configuration and client helper utilities for Email/Password Account Lifecycle. I will use the AWS Cognito service for this task, as it is a concrete third-party managed service that fits the requirements. The code will include the necessary imports, configuration setup, and helper functions to interact with AWS Cognito. </thinking>\n\n",
