        "text": "<thinking> To create the `password_reset.py` file, I need to integrate with a concrete external provider for the password reset flow. I will use Amazon Cognito for this task, as it is a widely used service for user authentication and management. The code will include the necessary imports and environment variables to identify the provider. </thinking>\n\n",
